WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.125 --> 00:00:01.126
SUPERCELL

00:00:01.877 --> 00:00:02.961
We're alive!

00:00:03.378 --> 00:00:04.796
Take that, space rocks.

00:00:05.088 --> 00:00:06.131
You nailed it.

00:00:06.381 --> 00:00:08.217
Alright, alright.
I think they should be okay.

00:00:08.383 --> 00:00:10.093
We made all the upgrades we could.

00:00:10.385 --> 00:00:13.055
All those beautiful memories together.

00:00:27.778 --> 00:00:30.447
This is what it means to be a Clan.

00:00:31.365 --> 00:00:34.535
Because together, we are indestruct...

00:00:38.455 --> 00:00:40.082
I can't look.
Is it bad?

00:00:40.207 --> 00:00:41.667
Well, it's not good.

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:44.044
Is this the afterlife?

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:47.923
Oh, no.
Our Town Hall.

00:00:49.383 --> 00:00:50.717
What is that thing?

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:05.399
That's so nice.

00:01:06.108 --> 00:01:08.402
I'm going to get
so many questions about this.

00:01:09.361 --> 00:01:12.447
Town Hall 18 has landed.
Upgrade now.

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:15.325
CLASH OF CLANS

